{{Distinguish|Chaotic Might}}

{{status
| name                   = Unholy Might
| type                   = Buff
| description            = Your Physical Damage is converted to Chaos Damage, and you have a 25% chance to Wither on hit
}}

'''Unholy Might''' is a [[buff]] that grants 100% of [[physical damage]] [[convert]]ed to [[chaos damage]], and 25% chance to inflict [[Withered]] on [[hit]].

==Mechanics==
{{see also|damage conversion}}
The effects of Unholy Might are affected by increased [[buff effect]]. The buff duration can be indirectly scaled by changing the buff [[expiration rate]].

==Unique items==
The following [[unique item]]s grant Unholy Might:
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=item_stats.id like "%Unholy_Might%" AND items.name NOT LIKE "%Extractor Mentis%"
|large=1
|base_item=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

* {{c|foulborn|[[Foulborn]]}} {{il|Darkscorn}}: {{c|foulborn|25% chance to gain Unholy Might for 4 seconds on Critical Strike}}
* {{c|foulborn|[[Foulborn]]}} {{il|Severed in Sleep}}/{{il|United in Dream}}: {{c|foulborn|Minions have 25% chance to gain Unholy Might for 4 seconds on Kill}}
* {{c|foulborn|[[Foulborn]]}} {{il|Vis Mortis}}: {{c|foulborn|Minions have Unholy Might}}
* Legacy {{il|Vis Mortis}} has the mod {{ml|MinionUnholyMightOnKillUniqueBodyInt9|display=stat_text}}

